### 1. Upstream project / 上游项目

The ARZ/ARC parsing portions are derived from **arzedit** by **WillSo**
(originally published on the Crate Entertainment forum and GitLab as
QuasiMod/arzedit). The upstream project does **not** include a license file.
The author of GDPackEditor has requested permission from the original author
but has not received a reply. Those portions are therefore **not** relicensed
under MIT; all rights remain with their original author. If the rightsholder
objects, the relevant content will be removed, replaced, or rewritten promptly.

ARZ/ARC 解析部分衍生自 **WillSo** 的 **arzedit**（原发布于 Crate Entertainment
官方论坛及 GitLab 的 QuasiMod/arzedit）。上游项目**未附带许可文件**。本工具作者
已向原作者申请授权，但未获回复。因此该部分**不纳入 MIT 授权**，权利仍归原作者。
如权利人提出异议，将立即删除、替换或重写相关内容。

The project also acknowledges **gd-utility** by **Ridwan Hidayatullah**
(MIT License): https://github.com/R-Hidayatullah/gd-utility

